{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《女神配對計劃2》第12集焦點畫面，係Oscar與女神何沛珈（Roxanne）展開極具挑戰性「單對單」過山車約 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《女神配對計劃2》第12集焦點畫面，係Oscar與女神何沛珈（Roxanne）展開極具挑戰性「單對單」過山車約會。本身都唔係特別大膽嘅Oscar拋開自身不安，主動拖手安撫嚇到面青的何沛珈，展現出強烈反差感。這次驚心動魄高空體驗更意外觸發女方突破防線，玩到失聲之後分享個人黑歷史！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534306197949475_19702951546b02c2d68e6b4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"14.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534306197949475_19702951546b02c2d68e6b4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534306456417996_9146023426b02c2d90fe52.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"27.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534306456417996_9146023426b02c2d90fe52.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>Oscar與Roxanne挑戰小丑過山車嚇破膽</h2>\n<p>今晚播出《女神配對計劃2》第12集中，Oscar與Roxanne約會選擇挑戰極度刺激小丑過山車，原本聲稱經歷過水上滑梯已無所畏懼女方，未上車已經連續驚呼「好驚呀！」。當過山車正式開動後，Roxanne瞬間嚇到花容失色兼且連環尖叫，甚至一度驚嚇過度導致面青唇白兼完全失聲。本身同樣十分害怕機動遊戲男方見狀立刻挺身而出，全程緊緊捉實Roxanne雙手給予滿滿安全感，更在車速稍為減慢時不斷出言「你o唔ok？」安撫，並輕拍對方大脾與膊頭，整個高空拖手護花畫面完全大放送。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534306643532282_17496450216b02c2db77600.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"15.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534306643532282_17496450216b02c2db77600.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>Roxanne直認男方全程緊握雙手感覺溫暖</h2>\n<p>經歷完這趟驚險萬分過山車之旅後，Roxanne事後接受訪問時大讚Oscar表現出極致細心與溫柔，並坦言對方連串暖心舉動成功融化她。她直指自己在車上嚇到失聲兼失去表情管理狀態下，全靠對方捉緊自己雙手才捱過難關，並向節目組表示「我覺得佢關注點喺我身上，而唔係淨係自己enjoy，我覺得warm嘅」。至於向節目組透露零追女仔經驗Oscar亦表示當時只顧著保護女方，完全忘記自身恐懼，他更主動探問女方喜好並用心聆聽，與過往怕羞仔形象截然不同。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534306910132086_17772759696b02c2dd79bc7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"19.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534306910132086_17772759696b02c2dd79bc7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>蘋果之夜約會令Oscar與Roxanne感情升溫</h2>\n<p>追溯兩人感情發展軌跡，自從早前共同經歷過甜蜜滿瀉「蘋果之夜」後，雙方關係已經出現突破性驚人進展。以往在節目中表現較為內斂Oscar開始打破悶局，積極向Roxanne發起單對單約會攻勢，兩人在相處過程中更經常互相打鬧鬥氣。今次單獨約會除了充滿刺激機動遊戲環節外，雙方更藉著獨處時間進行深度心靈交流，Roxanne將會首度揭開一直潛藏在內心深處對於「Emo男」恐懼心魔，並透露過往曾經因為情緒問題一度變得相當不理智，這段沉重往事令Oscar聽畢大感心痛。</p>\n<h2>節目預告引發大批網民留言作熱烈討論</h2>\n<p>第12集相關預告片段在網絡曝光後，隨即引來大批觀眾及網民熱烈討論。不少網民被Oscar在過山車上霸氣拖手一幕深深吸引，紛紛留言大讚「Oscar平時見佢好怕羞，估唔到遇到危急關頭咁有男子氣概」、「拖手嗰吓真係好man，完全加晒分」。同時亦有大批網民對Roxanne口中提及「Emo男」心結感到非常好奇，留言表示「好想知Roxanne以前到底經歷過啲咩創傷」、「希望Oscar可以用行動慢慢解開佢心結」，網上充斥大量針對兩人約會細節相關評論。</p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534159064117997_11409698256b02bd1719df8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179534159064117997_11409698256b02bd1719df8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p></p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/oscar/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Oscar</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/roxanne/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Roxanne</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3547870\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 22 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:03:54.178614+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1559,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:11:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:57:27.773106+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:30.220785+00:00","content_hash":"c704a21bd2c049d57676678d082942a3d4db1227f69d8c10a27f2ae01cee37e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}